# and sky model = make sky-model, both on ailang v0.52.0 + Godot 4.7.2.
# cns5.csv is sim/tools/extract.ail on CNS5 cns5.dat (download_stars.sh quick); gcns.csv is extract.ail on table1c.dat.
# cns5.dat (M1.2c) is VizieR J/A+A/670/A19 cns5.dat verbatim (4,502,658 B): the quick catalogue tier reads it and
